!!! Slots 1 — Powered Symbiote *(Hallmark Trait)*
Ichi's specific implementation of the generic trait (see Core Rules above).

''Bonded operator:'' Lady Aki

!!!! Gear Stats (Worn Mode)

| Stat | Value | Notes |
| ''Armor'' | +5 | Heritage Armoured Body (+1) + custom armor mod (+4, damaged) |
| ''Ward'' | +1 | Heritage Armoured Body (+1) |
| ''Size'' | 2 stone (Medium) | Operator's Powered Symbiote trait satisfies one of those slots; Mycelium-silk backing compresses and conforms |
| ''Features'' | powered (re 4), cool, environmental, living | |
| ''DT'' | 2 | Personal powered armor class (low end) |
| ''Category'' | Golem-class powered armor | |

''Stacking with Aki:'' Aki's Spider Folk heritage Armoured Body (+1 Armor, +1 Ward) stacks. ''Totals when Aki wears Ichi: +6 Armor, +2 Ward, DT 2.''

!!!! Installed Mods (3 item slots filled)

| Mod | Slot | Type | Effect |
| ''War-Memory Surge'' | 1 | Passive (Burn) | +2 STR while Burn is active |
| ''Ejection System'' | 1 | Reactive | Eject on failed Defeat trigger; cost −1 Level per Ejection (see core rules) |
| ''Armor Plating'' | 1 | Structural | +4 Armor (damaged; repairable to +5, +6, +7 through investment) |

!!!! Burn Mode

Activate as free action, roll d20 vs re 4:
* ''5+:'' Burn activates, battery holds. War-Memory Surge grants +2 STR.
* ''1–4:'' Burn activates, −1 effective Level. War-Memory Surge still grants +2 STR this scene, but system degrades.
* ''Level 0:'' Unpowered. Armor provides physical protection only. No Burn talents.
* ''Below 0:'' Defeat roll.

!!!! Ejection

On a Defeat trigger while worn: operator may Eject instead of rolling personal Defeat. Cost: Ichi takes −1 Level. Both prone. Operator survives at current Life, unarmored.

If Ichi remains above Level 0 after Ejection: may kip up and act autonomously next turn.
If Ichi at Level 0: Unpowered Emergency Mode (can act but no powered features).
If Ichi below Level 0: Ichi rolls Defeat.

!!!! Upgrade Trajectory

| State | Armor Mod | Total Armor (worn) | With Aki | Equivalent |
| ''Current (damaged)'' | +4 | +5 | +6 | Bone Mesh / Chain Mail |
| ''Repaired'' | +5 | +6 | +7 | Porcelain Walker class |
| ''Restored'' | +6 | +7 | +8 | Full Archaic (pristine) |
| ''Power Core'' | +7 | +8 | +9 | Beyond standard golem armor |

!!! Slot 2 — Dreamwalker *(Scion path)*

> "Dream, and your daemon-dream-self walks the dream realm."

For Ichi, this manifests as the ''mycelium dream-deck interface''. The spore substrate connects to the DreamNet and local noospheric signals during rest or meditation. Ichi can:

* ''Dream-walk ley-line networks'' — perceive the shape and health of local ley-lines from within the DreamNet
* ''Interface with lararia'' — connect to Lares nodes, potentially diagnosing damage or corruption
* ''Diagnose damaged infrastructure'' — directly relevant to the Neo-Thracian ley-line repair mission

''Open question (held by Liminal):'' What does Ichi //dream//? A millennia-old daemon merged with a newborn spore-consciousness — whose dreams dominate? The sergeant's last battle? The Mother Spore's mycorrhizal network memory? Something entirely new? This does not need answering yet.

