!! On Aki's Sheet!! Military Kit Recovery Register — RULING and OPEN

| Original item | Current record | Recovery vector |
|---|---|---|
| Yari | Originally issued; survival and whereabouts undecided | Determine what happened to original issue before calling it lost or recoverable |
| Tachi | Missing; original sword absent | Potential later recovery point of interest, without promising its original level or properties |
| Asymmetrical bow | Missing | Potential later recovery point of interest; special training or gauntlet links remain speculative |
| Rifle | Missing | Potential story recovery lead; power requirements and former interfaces unknown |
| Original kabuto | Not present as original; chitin reconstruction worn | Recover hardware and/or synthesize selectively with rebuilt kabuto |
| Original left gauntlet | Not present as original; chitin reconstruction worn | Recover hardware and/or synthesize selectively with rebuilt gauntlet |
| Original right greave | Not present as original; chitin reconstruction worn | Recover hardware and/or synthesize selectively with rebuilt greave |

''Present substitute kit:'' bokken paired with tantō. The existing crystal knife remains in the starter kit. Do not treat the field spade as another proven original-issue weapon; Ichi now holds it as a chosen personal Hallmark.

''Potential dormant-system states:'' De-leveled / power-starved, physically missing, locked, encrypted, damaged, corrupted, Vome-affected. A subsystem may bear several of these at once. Recovering energy can help diagnose or activate compatible intact systems but does not guarantee repair, authorization, integration or freedom from malfunction.

''Recovery/synthesis procedure proposal (not yet rules):'' locate provenance -> diagnose present state -> determine original and replacement compatibility -> decide with Ichi which functions should return -> use source-supported salvage, XP upgrades, material repair and/or rites -> test safely before installing. Record dangers and inventory use separately. Do not secretly award upgraded Armor, new actions, free Power activations or automatic conversion of reconstructed material into oldtech functions.

