!! On Aki's Sheet

''Ichi occupies:'' 1 item inventory slot (companion/hallmark) ''NOTE — SUPERSEDED FOR CURRENT DESIGN:'' Legacy rule text above originally treated Ichi as a Hallmark item of Aki. Operator ruling places him as her deuteragonist and maintained companion in Social Inventory, without consuming an ownership Hallmark slot. Their physical symbiosis still uses the established mode-switch, defense and burden accounting pending explicit mechanical reconciliation.
''Bond type:'' Symbiotic mycelium (physical/biological upkeep)
''When worn:'' Companion slot and worn-armor slot overlap — one entry
''Restriction:'' Cannot operate multiple Powered systems simultaneously

